  "fullDescription": "✌️ Bring back the groove with “Retro Outline”! ✌️\n\nRetro Outline is a bubbly, hand-drawn display font that perfectly captures the “Ultimate Cartoon Spirit” with a nostalgic vintage twist. Featuring bold, clean outlines and a playful silhouette, this font is designed to give your projects a fun, 70s-inspired look that pops off the page!\n\n🎨 The Perfect Font for Coloring & Crafting!\nWith its hollow center and smooth edges, Retro Outline is an excellent choice for creating coloring books and worksheets. It’s also incredibly “cut-friendly” for crafters using vinyl machines.",
